# Moxa ioLogik E2242.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik E2242 Ethernet Remote I/O — 4-channel AI + 12-channel DIO
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP port 502
# | 
# | DIO channels (ch0-11) are configurable as DI or DO via direction registers
# | FC01 (0xxxx R/W): DIO bit ctrl ch0-11 (0x0000-0x002F), DI counter ctrl (0x0030-0x0077)
# | FC02 (1xxxx R): DIO bit value ch0-11 (0x0000-0x000B)
# | FC04 (3xxxx R): DI count value u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0x0000-0x0017),
# | AI_rawValue ch0-3 (0x0200-0x0203)
# | FC03 (4xxxx R/W): primary register space below
# | 
# | CAUTION: AI_scaleValue f32 at 0x0130-0x0137 uses reversed word order —
# | lo-word at even address, hi-word at odd address (opposite of normal convention)
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E2242
@description=4-AI + 12-DIO Modbus/TCP Ethernet remote I/O (port 502). FC03: DO_pulseOutputCount u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0-23), DO_pulseLowWidth u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0x0018-0x002F=24-47, 2 words/ch), DO_pulseHighWidth u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0x0030-0x0047=48-71, 2 words/ch), DO_mode ch0-11 (0x0048-0x0053=72-83, 0=DO 1=Pulse), DI_countFilter ch0-11 (0x0054-0x005F=84-95), DI_mode ch0-11 (0x0060-0x006B=96-107, 0=DI 1=Count), AI_enable ch0-3 (0x006C-0x006F=108-111, 1=Enable 0=Disable), DO_value ch0-11 (0x0080-0x008B=128-139), DO_powerOnValue ch0-11 (0x008C-0x0097=140-151), DO_safeModeValue ch0-11 (0x0098-0x00A3=152-163), AI_scalingEnable ch0-3 (0x011C-0x011F=284-287), AI_rawMin ch0-3 (0x0120-0x0123=288-291), AI_rawMax ch0-3 (0x0124-0x0127=292-295), AI_scaleMin ch0-3 (0x0128-0x012B=296-299), AI_scaleMax ch0-3 (0x012C-0x012F=300-303), AI_scaleValue f32 ch0-3 (0x0130-0x0137=304-311; REVERSED word order: lo-word at even addr hi-word at odd addr), IntReg00-23 working (0x0150-0x0167=336-359), AI_range ch0-3 (0x0200-0x0203=512-515, 0=+/-150mV 1=+/-500mV 2=+/-5V 3=+/-10V 4=0-20mA 5=4-20mA 6=0-150mV 7=0-500mV 8=0-5V 9=0-10V), DI_counterModeValue ch0-11 (0x0D00-0x0D0B=3328-3339). FC04: DI_countValue u32 hi+lo ch0-11, AI_rawValue ch0-3 (0x0200-0x0203). FC01: DIO bit ctrl, DI counter ctrl. FC02: DIO_bitValue ch0-11.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-e2242.toml; Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
